       "value": "Telegraph office"
      },
      {
       "name": "lines",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The telegraph office, shuttered for the storm. A lamp still burns inside.\nOverhead, the wire runs up the valley. If the storm brings it down, there is no other way to send word out."
      }
